<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see showers.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see showers.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Thursday were forecast to see showers, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see showers and highs of 15 to 22 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see sun in the south, rain in the north and highs of 16 to 21 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see showers and highs of 16 to 21 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
